{"parentUuid":"beb5483a-77d8-45fc-8c78-295b6aaa3042","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dev/ledgerline","sessionId":"buried-07","version":"2.0.14","gitBranch":"report/q3-active","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_01ayuSXYSlKvPazKhoCF1sUO","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-sonnet-4-5","content":[{"type":"text","text":"13,500, the same as finance's dashboard, with no duplicate customers.\n\nQ3 2026 active customers (CRM active, not merged, paid invoice dated 1 July to 30 September), by plan and billing region:\n\n| plan | Benelux | DACH | France | Nordics | Other | UK | total |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| business | 701 | 2,509 | 455 | 633 | 503 | 792 | 5,593 |\n| pro | 591 | 2,140 | 407 | 528 | 432 | 661 | 4,759 |\n| starter | 383 | 1,428 | 272 | 320 | 278 | 467 | 3,148 |\n| total | 1,675 | 6,077 | 1,134 | 1,481 | 1,213 | 1,920 | 13,500 |\n\nstarter includes legacy-2019. The customer list is in data/reports/q3_active.csv.\n\nFor any later report from the CRM export: rows with merged_into set are merged accounts the CRM never deactivates, and they share the survivor's ledger id, so they have to be dropped or the customer is counted twice."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","usage":{"input_tokens":455,"output_tokens":343}},"uuid":"8d454b7d-eb7a-4bfe-b91c-b20d229d6fc9","timestamp":"2026-10-07T08:52:21.000Z","requestId":"req_011CghPKiX9GbhT30QXmhqNO"}
